@api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token
@refreshToken = replace-with-refresh-token
@groupId = replace-with-group-id
@permissionId = replace-with-permission-id
@organizationUnitId = replace-with-organization-unit-id
@userId = replace-with-user-id

### Application health
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Register
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe!23456"
}

###

### Login
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe!23456"
}

###

### Refresh
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Revoke
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Current user (includes groups, permissions, unit scope)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### List users (requires users.read)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Authorization context for current user
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### UI capabilities (permission metadata + user↔OU membership; not JWT)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/me/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Accessible organization units for current user (caller-scoped; not admin full tree)
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/me/organization-units?page=1&pageSize=50&isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Assign user to organization unit (membership metadata only — no data access grant)
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/users/organization-units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "organizationUnitId": "{{organizationUnitId}}",
  "relationship": "Primary"
}

###

### List user organization-unit memberships
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/users/{{userId}}/organization-units?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Revoke user organization-unit membership
DELETE {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/users/organization-units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "organizationUnitId": "{{organizationUnitId}}"
}

###

### List permission catalog
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get permission by id
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/permissions/{{permissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create permission (dynamic catalog entry)
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "invoice.export.excel",
  "name": "Export invoices to Excel",
  "module": "invoice",
  "action": "export.excel"
}

###

### List user groups
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get group by id
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create user group
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ban quan ly du an so 1",
  "description": "Scope for department 1"
}

###

### Assign permission to group
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/groups/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "permissionId": "{{permissionId}}"
}

###

### Assign user to group
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/groups/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

###

### List organization units
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/organization-units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get organization unit by id
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/organization-units/{{organizationUnitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create root organization unit
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/organization-units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "UBND Bac Ninh",
  "code": "UBND-BN",
  "parentId": null
}

###

### Create child organization unit
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/organization-units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ban quan ly du an dan dung va phat trien do thi so 1",
  "code": "BQLDA-1",
  "parentId": "{{organizationUnitId}}"
}

###

### Move organization unit under a new parent (null = root)
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/organization-units/{{organizationUnitId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": "{{newParentOrganizationUnitId}}"
}

###

### Assign organization unit scope to group
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/authorization/groups/organization-units
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "organizationUnitId": "{{organizationUnitId}}"
}

###
